{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/SessionLifecycle"]},{"anchor":"Running-the-host","title":"Running the host","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostCoordinator","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostConfiguration","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/SessionInfo","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/StreamHealth","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostCounters","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostLog"]},{"anchor":"Pairing-and-trust","title":"Pairing and trust","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/PairingService","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/TrustList","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/PairedDevice","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostKeys","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/LinkAddresses"]},{"anchor":"Input","title":"Input","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HostInputActor","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/InputDeviceID","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/InputInjector","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/EventPoster","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/LiveEventPoster","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/DryRunEventPoster"]},{"anchor":"Video","title":"Video","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HEVCParameterSets","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/EncodedFrame","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/VirtualDisplayHost"]},{"anchor":"Calibration","title":"Calibration","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/CalibrationDesk","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/CalibrationPresenter","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/CalibrationOverlay","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HeadlessCalibrationPresenter","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/CalibrationScreen"]},{"anchor":"Bluetooth","title":"Bluetooth","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/SourceModeCentral","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/SourceModeRadio","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/SourceModeRadioEvent","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/LiveSourceModeRadio","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/BluetoothPairingAgent","doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/BluetoothAgentEvent"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Extended-Modules","title":"Extended Modules","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/HeadwireGATTContract"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"HeadwireMacHost runs the helper’s host. It listens for paired devices on the USB cable, the network and Direct wireless over TLS with both keys pinned, captures a display with ScreenCaptureKit, encodes it with a low-latency HEVC encoder, sends the frames and the Mac’s sound to each device, and posts the input each device sends back as ","type":"text"},{"code":"CGEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s. It also runs the pairing window, keeps the trust list and the helper’s key in the keychain, draws the calibration strip a device asks for, and reads the iPad’s source mode request over the Bluetooth link the Mac already holds for HID. It does not decide what a person sees: the menu’s switches, the permissions, the build and the capture display’s mode are resolved by ","type":"text"},{"code":"HeadwireMacKit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s value types, and the menu itself belongs to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"HeadwireMac","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" app. The wire formats come from ","type":"text"},{"code":"HeadwireWire","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and the input events from ","type":"text"},{"code":"HeadwireInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so both ends share one implementation. Much of the streaming and input code is derived from ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Saffsanity\/sill","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", under the Apache License 2.0.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The virtual display, Sidecar and the private Bluetooth pairing agent are compiled only into the Direct build and are not documented here.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/headwiremachost"]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"collection","title":"HeadwireMacHost","externalID":"HeadwireMacHost","roleHeading":"Framework","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"HeadwireMacHost"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Headwire Helper’s streaming, input and pairing: the code that serves paired devices from the Mac."}],"references":{"doc://HeadwireMacHost/documentation/HeadwireMacHost/BluetoothAgentEvent":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/BluetoothAgentEvent","title":"BluetoothAgentEvent","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BluetoothAgentEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/headwiremachost\/bluetoothagentevent","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BluetoothAgentEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What an agent reports back."}],"r